// Lionfell minimap (mockup: map with zoom buttons on top, footer with coordinates and
// floor). minimap.lua addresses minimapBorder.minimap, layersPanel.* and rosePanel.*, so
// those widgets stay; the compass rose and layer slider are hidden. The footer text is
// filled in by game_lionfell_hud.

LfMapButton < UIButton
  size: 24 24
  ttf-font: GeistMono-Medium
  ttf-font-size: 13
  color: #cfccc7
  image-source: /images/lionfell/fill_r4
  image-border: 4
  image-color: #101112e6
  change-cursor-image: true
  cursor: pointer

  $hover:
    color: #ffffff
    image-color: #25272a

LfPhantomPanel
  id: mainmappanel
  &panelHeight: 290
  height: 290
  padding: 8

  UIWidget
    id: minimapBorder
    anchors.top: parent.top
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    height: 244
    background-color: #212320

    Minimap
      id: minimap
      anchors.fill: parent

  LfMapButton
    id: zoomIn
    text: +
    !tooltip: tr('Zoom in')
    anchors.top: minimapBorder.top
    anchors.right: minimapBorder.right
    margin-top: 6
    margin-right: 6
    @onClick: zoomIn()

  LfMapButton
    id: zoomOut
    text: -
    !tooltip: tr('Zoom out')
    anchors.top: zoomIn.bottom
    anchors.right: zoomIn.right
    margin-top: 3
    @onClick: zoomOut()

  LfMapButton
    id: fullMap
    !tooltip: tr('Open the world map')
    anchors.top: zoomOut.bottom
    anchors.right: zoomIn.right
    margin-top: 3
    icon-source: /images/automap/automap_buttons
    icon-clip: 0 0 20 20
    @onClick: openCyclopediaMap()

  UIWidget
    id: footer
    anchors.top: minimapBorder.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
    margin-top: 8
    padding: 0 2 0 2

    UILabel
      id: coords
      anchors.left: parent.left
      anchors.verticalCenter: parent.verticalCenter
      ttf-font: GeistMono-Regular
      ttf-font-size: 11
      color: #8d8a86
      text-auto-resize: true
      phantom: true

    UIButton
      id: floorDown
      !tooltip: tr('Show the floor below')
      anchors.right: parent.right
      anchors.verticalCenter: parent.verticalCenter
      size: 14 14
      icon-source: /images/lionfell/tri_down
      icon-color: #6f6c68
      change-cursor-image: true
      cursor: pointer
      @onClick: downLayer()

      $hover:
        icon-color: #e7e5e2

    UILabel
      id: floor
      anchors.right: floorDown.left
      anchors.verticalCenter: parent.verticalCenter
      margin-right: 4
      ttf-font: GeistMono-Medium
      ttf-font-size: 11
      color: #e7e5e2
      text-auto-resize: true
      phantom: true

    UIButton
      id: floorUp
      !tooltip: tr('Show the floor above')
      anchors.right: floor.left
      anchors.verticalCenter: parent.verticalCenter
      margin-right: 4
      size: 14 14
      icon-source: /images/lionfell/tri_up
      icon-color: #6f6c68
      change-cursor-image: true
      cursor: pointer
      @onClick: upLayer()

      $hover:
        icon-color: #e7e5e2

  // kept for minimap.lua; not part of this layout
  UIWidget
    id: layersPanel
    visible: false
    size: 0 0

    UIWidget
      id: automapLayers
      image-source: /images/automap/automap_indicator_maplayers
      image-clip: 98 0 14 67
      size: 14 67

    UIWidget
      id: layersMark

  UIWidget
    id: rosePanel
    visible: false
    size: 0 0

    UIWidget
      id: ambients

      UIWidget
        id: main
        image-source: /images/automap/timedisplay_scroll

      UIWidget
        id: secondary
        image-source: /images/automap/timedisplay_scroll

    UIWidget
      id: rose
